<title>USA: Heller Financial issues $200 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Heller Financial issues $200 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following investment grade debt issue from Heller Financial Inc was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER HELLER FINANCIAL INC</p>
<p>AMT $200 MILLION    COUPON 6.50 PCT   MATURITY 11/1/01</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES	ISS PRICE 99.673  FIRST PAY DATE 5/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A2	 YIELD 6.578 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB+	 SPREAD 49 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>-- U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
